body: "Overlap refreshed: published core previewItemMutations owns canonical transaction semantics; CSV owns CSV schemas and mapping; Beads owns its external format. Native preflight supplies agents without Node or Git and introduces no importer dialect. Reuse native apply functions in disposable bounded snapshots; source bytes remain unchanged. No lock-based isolation or live commit guarantee is claimed."
